      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Install this Composer; the regional engine is included.\n2. Choose YOUR Krea 2 model, Krea 2 Qwen3-VL encoder (CLIPLoader type krea2) and VAE.\n3. Select two Krea 2 character LoRAs and put each trigger word in its Trigger field.\n4. Character 1 percent = 60 means left 60% / right 40%. Change Direction for top/bottom.\n5. Optional: fill Negative prompt. This needs the NegPiP Prompt pack (comfyui-negpip-zimage).\n6. Sampler uses 8 steps / CFG 1 as a Turbo starting point. For RAW, use your working RAW settings.\n7. Direction 'Free boxes' places two boxes you can drag in the preview. A MASK on character_1_mask or character_2_mask replaces that character's area.\n8. Use Strong if character features mix. Connect 'prompts' to Preview Any to see what was encoded."
      ],
      "title": "Start here"
    }
